RADIO TAISO 64 v1.0 - Commodore 64 (PAL/NTSC)
Japan's radio calisthenics on the C64:
Radio Taiso No.1 and No.2, a multiplexed
sprite coach leads all 13 movements to
original SID music. JP+EN counts, 5 tempos,
opened borders, border cue scroller.
Freeware, D64 + PRG. Source on GitHub (MIT).
Advancing Development 2026, coded with
assistance from Anthropic's Claude.
radiotaiso.org  *  advancing.itch.io
